ok
still Connection refused
you have a service running on port 80 yes? (&quot;telnet 127.0.0.1 80&quot; works?)
yes
something is wrong with iptables
hm. I'm not sure... sorry....
maybe: iptables -t nat -A PREROUTING -s 0.0.0.0/0 -d  YOURIP p tcp --dport 8080 -j DNAT --to 127.0.0.1:80
